  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66af0088b02874ec",
      "translationZh": "理解ChatGPT Work"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e444148c9f4c423c",
      "translationZh": "Simon Willison的网络日志"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7311d0dd0c4d24e",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI于7月9日宣布了ChatGPT Work，并在此后疯狂地进行迭代。它是一个极其令人困惑但非常强大的产品。以下是我目前对它的了解。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "136d39d6b50ab32c",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Work实际上是两个产品"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4a0c2a862853410",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Work中更有趣的版本是运行在云端的那个。这可以通过chatgpt.com或ChatGPT移动应用访问。我们称它为Work Cloud。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c65e85fe6906c05",
      "translationZh": "如果你安装了ChatGPT桌面应用——那个曾经被称为Codex的应用——你就可以获得一个名为ChatGPT Work的功能，它可以直接访问你电脑上的文件并运行程序。我们称它为Work Local。这个感觉更像是普通的Codex重新包装，以降低对非软件开发者的威慑感。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96a7af54913bfbc7",
      "translationZh": "（更新：Work Cloud也可以通过ChatGPT桌面应用访问，通过一个“此聊天应在何处运行？”的下拉菜单。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de81c81b0532685e",
      "translationZh": "在本文的其余部分，我将专门讨论Work Cloud。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "33b7e978e3bfe336",
      "translationZh": "Work仅对付费订阅者开放"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "917bf5fbc3258c42",
      "translationZh": "目前，ChatGPT Work（两种版本）仅对20/月及以上的订阅者开放。免费用户和8/月Go用户无法访问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "10f58ec21a935d1a",
      "translationZh": "Work拥有Chat中没有的功能"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b92872feff02d58c",
      "translationZh": "访问Work的界面是一个标签选择器，它将其作为Chat的替代方案呈现："
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aba0c92e387dd38a",
      "translationZh": "显而易见的问题是，我什么时候应该使用Chat，什么时候应该使用Work？"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cafc55226adffe7f",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI对该问题的官方回答是："
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f174b32b3e8f8d52",
      "translationZh": "当你想要一个答案、解释、头脑风暴或简短草稿时，请使用Chat。当你想让ChatGPT完成具有明确结果的任务（例如简报、演示文稿、分析、定期更新、工作流或你可以查看和使用的文件）时，请使用ChatGPT Work。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75ccae553e320781",
      "translationZh": "我觉得这几乎完全没用，因为我已经使用普通的ChatGPT Chat处理了所有这些任务类别多年！"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aabb79afc4fc9ec4",
      "translationZh": "那么更好的问题是，Work拥有哪些Chat中缺失的功能？"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca7befc654b2f71f",
      "translationZh": "经过广泛的实验，我想我基本上已经弄清楚了："
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef91e57338121cd2",
      "translationZh": "使用Luna和Terra代替Sol的选项"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8923b06a05a88fb1",
      "translationZh": "具有互联网访问权限的代码执行环境"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78d1324e215df871",
      "translationZh": "无头 Chrome 浏览器"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b11f1f4d1ed8d8c8",
      "translationZh": "跨会话共享的持久化文件系统"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07424abf793e9da3",
      "translationZh": "发布 ChatGPT Sites 的能力"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d643f1b5e7eb2715",
      "translationZh": "使用 Sol、Luna 和 Terra 运行子代理会话的能力"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "854cf0dc66043437",
      "translationZh": "定时提示词自动化（可能在 ChatGPT Chat 中也有）"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "513534eb7be131b0",
      "translationZh": "在 Work 中，你可以选择 GPT-5.6 Sol、Luna 或 Terra，每个模型都提供 Light（轻度）、Medium（中等）、High（高度）、Extra High（极高）、Max（最大）或 Ultra（极致）推理级别。你也可以选择 GPT-5.5 的 Light、Medium、High 或 Extra High 级别。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804ef03d73e795ac",
      "translationZh": "这些看起来与通过 OpenAI API 提供的模型相同。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d2caedaabe461c0",
      "translationZh": "Chat 提供了不同的选择：5.6 Instant、Medium、High、Extra High 和 Pro（实际上，Extra High 和 Pro 仅对每月 100 美元以上的订阅用户开放——每月 20 美元的订阅用户最高只能达到 High）。它没有说明这些是 Luna、Terra 还是 Sol（我猜是 Sol？）。5.6 Pro 似乎是 Chat 独有的，在 Work 中没有对应版本。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d73038a3619b092b",
      "translationZh": "根据我目前使用 Codex 的经验，Ultra 是一种特殊模式，会更主动地将任务委派给子代理。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e1fb244f9609da0",
      "translationZh": "我相信 ChatGPT Work 会话会消耗你的 Codex 配额，而 ChatGPT Chat 会话则有自己独立的配额。这可能有助于解释模型可用性的差异。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dba0b24f04e17ddb",
      "translationZh": "带有互联网访问权限的代码执行！"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4d9be9cc8f6343e",
      "translationZh": "作为 Code Interpreter 模式（由 OpenAI 于 2023 年开创）的长期粉丝，这对我来说是 ChatGPT Work（云版）迄今为止最令人兴奋的功能。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3298ed85c735638c",
      "translationZh": "代码执行环境现在可以与互联网的其他部分进行交互了！"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ba16c6c43d0afad",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Chat 无法做到这一点——如果你要求它安装额外的软件包或与网站或 API 交互，这些访问将被容器代理阻止。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81512b0b7cc19e6c",
      "translationZh": "（奇怪的是，今年一月它获得了安装包的能力，但这似乎不再有效了。我希望他们有更好的更新日志！）"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "250aa44aa4fb26a2",
      "translationZh": "自去年九月推出以来，Claude 的等效容器就允许受限的互联网访问。Claude 可以从 PYPI 和 NPM 安装包，并从 GitHub 克隆仓库。但仅此而已：允许的域名白名单非常短。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6a6f77f8e35cec5",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Work 允许的远远不止这些。它可以配置特定的允许域名列表，但默认似乎是完全开放的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c989864aa33c6cd",
      "translationZh": "这使得 Work 成为一个极其有用的工具。你可以让它克隆 GitHub 仓库，安装它们的依赖项，然后使用它们与网络的其他部分进行交互！"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "68007ca6c3637c4d",
      "translationZh": "完整的无头 Chrome 浏览器"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59069fb917208b8b",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Work 的另一个杀手级功能是浏览器工具。ChatGPT Work 可以启动一个完整的 Chrome 实例，加载网站，填写表单并截取屏幕截图。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d36391930305b6cc",
      "translationZh": "它甚至可以对已加载页面的 DOM 运行 JavaScript。我提示道："
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2257ee136a07a61",
      "translationZh": "在你的浏览器中加载 simonwillison.net 并使用 JavaScript 提取标题"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e996c11718e8bb9a",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Work 启动了一个浏览器实例并运行了代码："
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34e36776044e2005",
      "translationZh": "这感觉非常像我的 shot-scraper javascript 工具，只是现在我可以从手机上访问它了！"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3a4bc28f8439a852",
      "translationZh": "一个持久化、共享的文件系统"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "892951e9da839be7",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Chat 为每个聊天会话提供一个全新的文件系统。这些文件系统无法从任何其他会话访问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad20ebefee0b1cae",
      "translationZh": "在 ChatGPT Work 中，每个会话都有自己的临时文件夹——名称类似于 /workspace/scratch/e00a0a017944 ——但每个文件夹都会在会话之间持久化保存，因此你可以访问之前聊天中的文件。我现在在 /workspace/scratch 中有 171 个文件夹！"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c78e2a923e18f2f9",
      "translationZh": "据我所知，该 /workspace 卷被挂载到所有当前正在运行的 Work 会话中——一个会话中的文件编辑可以被其他会话立即看到。不过它们似乎并不共享相同的进程空间，在一个会话中运行的 localhost 服务器无法从另一个会话访问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17f3ea3af32f09f3",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Work 具有使用 Cloudflare Workers 构建和部署整个网站的能力。这些网站可以包含 HTML 和 JavaScript，并且可以运行服务端功能，包括基于 Cloudflare D1 和 R2 的有状态功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7f4e2c870687306",
      "translationZh": "这是我使用该功能构建的一个简单网站：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4bfff32c9ef0782",
      "translationZh": "找出伦敦所有带有“虔诚鹈鹕”图案的地方，然后将其转换为 JSON 文件，并围绕这些地方构建一个 ChatGPT sites 网站。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d95d6087ccaafd28",
      "translationZh": "（在虔诚中的鹈鹕是中世纪基督教图像学中一个迷人的元素——一旦你了解了它们，就会发现它们随处可见。）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bf17b77790f5e11",
      "translationZh": "这些站点默认对创建者私有，但您可以将其设为公开，并且（在团队方案中）与特定的其他个人进行共享。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "41da710c9e1fb055",
      "translationZh": "包含 Sol、Luna 和 Terra 的子代理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "157c35cb67690892",
      "translationZh": "关于这个，没太多可说的。ChatGPT Chat 无法运行子代理（sub-agents），但 ChatGPT Work 可以。这完全是一个高级用户功能：如果你正在运行一个可以从多个并行代理协同工作中获益的复杂项目，Work 可以做到这一点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0df61c548e740355",
      "translationZh": "定时提示词自动化",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d23b013d41e11d1",
      "translationZh": "另一个似乎在某个时间点从普通版 ChatGPT 迁移到 ChatGPT Work 的功能。你可以像这样向 ChatGPT Work 发出提示词：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ec7d768db36474f",
      "translationZh": "每天早上8点运行一次搜索，查看 Waymo 是否宣布了在 Half Moon Bay 的发布日期",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d183ed43621f7e8",
      "translationZh": "这将按该频率调度提示词运行。这些提示词可以判定没有发生任何有趣的事情，也可以决定向您通知某些新信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72451e0757158280",
      "translationZh": "更新：实际上，这在 ChatGPT Chat 中似乎也有效。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "561ce712088f51c0",
      "translationZh": "不过，这里仍值得注意，因为它还可以与其他 ChatGPT Work 专属功能结合使用。例如，您可以设置定时任务，每小时更新一次 ChatGPT Site。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87067b4d67541787",
      "translationZh": "对我来说，目前一个悬而未决的问题是这一切到底有多安全。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e1b511e34130ab0",
      "translationZh": "我的致命三要素模型警告称，任何将访问私有数据的权限、暴露于不可信内容的风险以及将窃取的信息传回攻击者的途径相结合的智能体系统，都存在内在风险。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31424b60d1187737",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT Work 将这三者结合在了一起！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76cd244a91b835bc",
      "translationZh": "我很想听听 OpenAI 更多关于他们如何保护 ChatGPT Work 会话免受提示词注入攻击的内容。我预计他们的回答会与 Codex 使用的自动审查机制相同。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8c486a4b1f52e6d",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 可能会让这件事变得不再那么令人困惑",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebac3f31bc476d39",
      "translationZh": "弄清楚这一切所花费的工作量远比预想的要多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e57a7cfc3713dce",
      "translationZh": "我认为这里有两个关键问题：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73121dad2caed501",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 解释道：要从工作的作用（目的）出发进行说明，而不是从工作的实际操作出发",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d01ccce721fe8772",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 仍然坚持隐藏其系统提示词和工具描述",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a15fdef3089f05d",
      "translationZh": "如果 ChatGPT Work 文档中包含了该智能体所使用的确切系统提示词（system prompt）和工具描述，我就不需要写这篇帖子了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e6f57f23538b262f",
      "translationZh": "所有工具列表",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02d91367e1c71b57",
      "translationZh": "在发布这篇文章后不久，我产生了一个想法。我开启了一个新的 Work 会话并输入提示词：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7e01d5bc19d6e59",
      "translationZh": "构建一个网站，列出你的每一个工具——几乎按类别分组——并解释每个工具的功能。尽可能尝试完全复制参数和工具描述。设计风格应为技术文档，保持极简，不要花哨",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0af094a52c013bb",
      "translationZh": "这就是它构建的网站，其中包含了 223 个已注册工具的详细信息——不过其中有 6 个是我通过 datasette-mcp 提供个人的 MCP",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ed8fe7c06334f170",
      "translationZh": "以及大量的技能",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9f1b2fce53451fa",
      "translationZh": "我注意到列表中唯一与浏览器相关的工具是 web.run，它具有运行搜索、打开 URL 和点击链接的方法，但在无头浏览器自动化方面看起来并不完整。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec830ce9ee629ccf",
      "translationZh": "这让我怀疑遗漏了某些内容，所以我告诉构建该工具参考网站的 ChatGPT Work 会话：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d88704c90fd0624",
      "translationZh": "将每个技能的完整副本添加到网站中（通过首页链接到独立的页面）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71ebda978759b0a8",
      "translationZh": "事实证明，ChatGPT Work 使用了许多技能——实际上有 44 个！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2e48db93c8e96df",
      "translationZh": "control-browser 技能解释了浏览器是如何工作的：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08017d9137ffe045",
      "translationZh": "通过 Node REPL js 工具运行浏览器设置代码。在此环境中，可调用工具 ID 通常显示为 mcp__node_repl__js . [...]",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7bedf0cd9d59553",
      "translationZh": "直接与浏览器交互的能力通过 agent.browsers.* API 在 browser-client 运行时中暴露。在尝试与之交互之前，您必须一次性发出并读取 await browser.documentation() 返回的完整文档。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dc9aeb4e0f406e5",
      "translationZh": "将 await browser.documentation() 的完整输出添加到 /skills/control-browser 页面的底部",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee11a0b8fe52cd82",
      "translationZh": "现在您也可以在 /skills/control-browser 上阅读该内容了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd41850c73bc501a",
      "translationZh": "更多有趣的技能：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
